	"30|50|i0g1|Well done, \fcScrubs\f7.\nI am proud...",
	"-|||You know what comes\nnext.",
	"67|57|i7a1|\fcYes, \f7Purity\fc.",
	"104|50|i7e1|\ffI'll miss you, \fcScrubs\ff.",
	"67|57|i7a1|\fcAnd I you, \ffScorch\fc.",
	"!|-.1,2|.1,2|0,2",
	"67|57|i7a1|\fcOh!\nWhat's this?",
	"-|||\fcA primitive form,\nbrought to life?",
	"104|50|i7e1|\ffIt's exceptionally\npure...",
	--"67|57|i7a1|\fcAs such forms do\ntend to be.",
	"30|50|i0g1|But not perfectly so.\nNothing is anymore...",
	"-|||I wished to see \fcyou\f7\noff, but as \ffScorch\f7 &\nI must be going,",
