	"30|50|i0g1|Your dignity is a\nsmall price to pay for\npurity.",
	"104|50|i7e1|\ffYes... \f7Purity\ff.",	
	"!|-.25,3|.15,1|0,3",
	"104|50|i7e1|\ff..."
